runner-deploy UNSOUND: session reservation mode unset: the per-session budget is an operator operating-point choice (REGIME-1 worst-case cap C * concurrency N, or REGIME-2 measured aggregate with C as the oomd eviction ceiling) grounded in the measured distribution (min 0.28 / median ~2.06 / max 8.27 GiB); refuse to derive the host sessions-slice (and therefore the conserving runner count) until gunbc_ci_session_reservation_mode is set. See the operating curve in the manifest.
session-reservation UNSOUND: session reservation mode unset: the per-session budget is an operator operating-point choice (REGIME-1 worst-case cap C * concurrency N, or REGIME-2 measured aggregate with C as the oomd eviction ceiling) grounded in the measured distribution (min 0.28 / median ~2.06 / max 8.27 GiB); refuse to derive the host sessions-slice (and therefore the conserving runner count) until gunbc_ci_session_reservation_mode is set. See the operating curve in the manifest.
